Investment Incentives Order, 2001 (S 48/2001) Pioneer Industries and Pioneer Products Order, 2013 Contents Article 1 Citation Article 2 Declaration as pioneer industry and pioneer product Investment Incentives Order, 2001 (S 48/2001) Pioneer Industries and Pioneer Products Order, 2013 In exercise of the powers conferred by section 4(1) of the Investment Incentives Act, 2001, the Ministry of Industry and Primary Resources makes the following Order— Article 1 Citation This Order may be cited as the Pioneer Industries and Pioneer Products Order, 2013.
Article 2 Declaration as pioneer industry and pioneer product The industries specified in the first column of the Schedule and the products specified in the second column thereof are respectively declared to be pioneer industries and pioneer products.
SCHEDULE Industry Product Preparation of animal feed pet feed;
preparation of livestock feed, including animal concentrate feed and feed additives, and unmixed (single) feed;
animal feed produced from the processing of slaughterhouse waste.
Made this 12th day of the 11th month of 1434 Hijri, corresponding to the 19th day of February, 2013.
